### Validation Status Check

**17p5-18deg-75s-N2-1800s**: runs 1–6 exist. Run1 (936 bar, 0.27 PF) is the highest modulus but based on a single fit specimen (SD=0, only 1 fit survived). Runs 2 (675, 0.30), 4 (null), 5 (null), 6 (659, 0.31) show much lower modulus. Run1 appears to be an outlier; the reproducible modulus is ~650–680 bar with PF ~0.30.

